wecom-chat-export — third-party notices
======================================

This project bundles, under `scripts/`, a modified copy of the WeCom
(wxSQLite3 AES-128-CBC) database decryption and message-export engine
originally published by the community as:

  - Source mirror: https://github.com/kenchikuliu/wechat-local-backup-search
  - Original (DMCA-removed): https://github.com/ylytdeng/wechat-decrypt

Bundled files derived from that project:
  scripts/wxwork_crypto.py
  scripts/find_wxwork_keys.py
  scripts/key_scan_common.py
  scripts/key_utils.py
  scripts/decrypt_wxwork_db.py
  scripts/export_wxwork_messages.py
  scripts/config.py

